<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Work Permit</title>
    <style>
      * {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      .mainContainer {
        margin: 0rem auto;
        padding: 30px;
        font-size: 14px;
        text-align: justify;
      }

      /* start main css content from here  */
      .container {
        width: 95%;
        margin: 0 auto;
        font-size: 14px;
        text-align: justify;
        padding: 15px 35px;
      }

      .container p {
        font-size: 13px !important;
      }

      .application-date {
        display: -webkit-box;
        display: -ms-flexbox;
        display: flex;
        -webkit-box-align: center;
        -ms-flex-align: center;
        align-items: center;
        -webkit-box-pack: justify;
        -ms-flex-pack: justify;
        justify-content: space-between;
        margin: 0.75rem 0rem;
        font-weight: bold;
      }

      .subject {
        margin: 0.75rem 0rem !important;
      }

      .subject b {
        display: block;
        font-size: 13px;
        line-height: 1.5;
      }

      .subject .sub {
        font-size: 13px;
        margin: 0.4rem 0rem;
      }

      .application-text p {
        font-size: 13.5px !important;
        line-height: 1.8;
        margin: 0.75rem 0rem;
      }

      table.GeneratedTable {
        background-color: #ffffff;
        border-collapse: collapse;
        margin: 0 auto !important;
      }

      table.GeneratedTable td,
      table.GeneratedTable th {
        border: 1px solid black;
      }

      table.GeneratedTable thead {
        background-color: transparent;
      }

      table.GeneratedTable {
        width: 100%;
        background-color: transparent;
        border-collapse: collapse;
        border-width: 1px;
        border-color: #000000;
        border-style: solid;
        color: #000000;
      }

      table.GeneratedTable td,
      table.GeneratedTable th {
        border-width: 1px;
        border-color: #000000;
        border-style: solid;
        padding: 5px;
      }

      table.GeneratedTable thead {
        background-color: transparent;
      }

      /* customize table */

      .second-page {
        margin-top: 2.5rem;
      }

      .child-td {
        padding: 0rem !important;
        border: none !important;
      }

      .child-td tr {
        text-align: center;
      }

      .child-tbody td {
        padding: 1rem 0rem !important;
      }

      th {
        font-size: 11.8px;
      }

      td {
        font-size: 11.5px;
      }

      .first-th {
        width: 20% !important;
      }

      .second-th {
        width: 15% !important;
      }

      .first-td {
        text-align: center;
        line-height: 2;
      }

      .un-order {
        padding-top: 1rem;
      }

      .un-order li {
        font-size: 12.5px !important;
        line-height: 1.6 !important;
        margin-top: 0.4rem;
      }

      footer ol {
        margin-top: 0.5rem;
      }

      footer {
        display: -webkit-box;
        display: -ms-flexbox;
        display: flex;
        -webkit-box-align: center;
        -ms-flex-align: center;
        align-items: center;
        /* -webkit-box-pack: justify;
        -ms-flex-pack: justify;
        justify-content: center; */
        margin-top: 2.5rem;
      }

      footer ol li {
        font-size: 11.5px;
        line-height: 1.3;
        margin-top: 0.4rem;
      }

      .cc-item {
        width: 60%;
      }

      .signature {
        text-align: center !important;
        line-height: 1.5 !important;
        width: 40%;
      }

      .signature small {
        display: block;
        font-size: 12px !important;
      }

      .signature img {
        width: 60% !important;
        border-bottom: 1px solid black;
      }

      .signature p {
        font-size: 13px;
        font-weight: bold;
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="application-date">
        <div>
          <p>
            Tracking No:<%= formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.trackingId
            )%>
          </p>
          <p>
            Type of Visa: <%=
            formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.typeOfVisaObtainedForTheIncumbentForeignNationals
            )%>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p>
            Approval Date: <%=
            formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.certificateGenerateDate )%>
          </p>
          <p>
            <%= formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.lastAmendmentDate )%>
          </p>
          <p>
            <%= formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.cancellationDate )%>
          </p>
          <p>
            Work Permit Type: Cancellation
            <!-- <%=
            formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.workPermitType )%> -->
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="subject">
        <b>Managing Director,</b>
        <b>
          <%=
          formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.proposedProjectCompanyName
          )%>
        </b>
        <%- formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.plotAddress )%>
        <b></b>
        <b>
          <%= formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.economicZoneAddress )%>
        </b>
        <b class="sub">Subject: Work Permit for Foreign National.</b>
      </div>
      <div style="margin: 0.45rem 0rem">
        <p>Dear Sir,</p>
      </div>

      <div class="application-text">
        <p>
          With reference to your application received on the above subject, this
          is to inform you that Bangladesh Economic Zone Authority (BEZA) has
          been pleased to issue work permit for the following foreign national
          employed in your company / office for the period shown against his
          name on the terms, conditions and remuneration as shown below :
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="remuneration-box" style="margin-top: 0.75rem">
        <table class="GeneratedTable">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th class="first-th">
                Name, Designation <br />
                Nationality and Passport No
              </th>
              <th class="second-th">Effectiveness</th>
              <th class="third-th">Remuneration</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td class="first-td">
                <%=
                formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.nameOfTheForeignNational
                )%> <br />
                <%=
                formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.nameOfThePostEmployedOfDesignation
                )%>
                <br />
                <%=
                formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.particularsNationality
                )%><br />
                <%= formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.passport1 )%>
              </td>
              <td>
                Effective date of Cancellation is
                <%=
                formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.desireEffectiveDateOfCancelation
                )%>
              </td>
              <td class="child-td">
                <table class="GeneratedTable">
                  <thead>
                    <tr>
                      <th>Payment</th>
                      <th>Payable Locally</th>
                      <th>Payable Abroad</th>
                    </tr>
                  </thead>
                  <tbody class="child-tbody">
                    <tr>
                      <td>
                        <% if (formValue.utils.isAddNAText(formValue.type_visa))
                        { %>
                        <span>N/A</span>
                        <% } else { %> <%=
                        formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.payment )%> <%
                        } %>
                      </td>
                      <td>
                        Basic Salary: <% if
                        (formValue.utils.isAddNAText(formValue.type_visa)) { %>
                        <span>N/A</span>
                        <% } else { %> <%=
                        formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.currencyLocally
                        )%> <%=
                        formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.amountLocally
                        )%> <% } %>
                      </td>
                      <td>
                        Basic Salary: <% if
                        (formValue.utils.isAddNAText(formValue.type_visa)) { %>
                        <span>N/A</span>
                        <% } else { %> <%=
                        formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.currencyLocally7
                        )%> <%=
                        formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.amountAbroad
                        )%> <% } %>
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                      <td>
                        <% if (formValue.utils.isAddNAText(formValue.type_visa))
                        { %>
                        <span>N/A</span>
                        <% } else { %> <%=
                        formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.payment3 )%> <%
                        } %>
                      </td>
                      <td>
                        Conveyance: <% if
                        (formValue.utils.isAddNAText(formValue.type_visa)) { %>
                        <span>N/A</span>
                        <% } else { %> <%=
                        formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.currencyLocally3
                        )%> <%=
                        formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.amountLocally3
                        )%> <% } %>
                      </td>
                      <td>
                        Conveyance: <% if
                        (formValue.utils.isAddNAText(formValue.type_visa)) { %>
                        <span>N/A</span>
                        <% } else { %> <%=
                        formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.currencyLocally11
                        )%> <%=
                        formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.amountAbroad3
                        )%> <% } %>
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                      <td>
                        <% if (formValue.utils.isAddNAText(formValue.type_visa))
                        { %>
                        <span>N/A</span>
                        <% } else { %> <%=
                        formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.payment1 )%> <%
                        } %>
                      </td>
                      <td>
                        Overseas Allowance: <% if
                        (formValue.utils.isAddNAText(formValue.type_visa)) { %>
                        <span>N/A</span>
                        <% } else { %> <%=
                        formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.currencyLocally1
                        )%> <%=
                        formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.amountLocally1
                        )%> <% } %>
                      </td>
                      <td>
                        Overseas Allowance: <% if
                        (formValue.utils.isAddNAText(formValue.type_visa)) { %>
                        <span>N/A</span>
                        <% } else { %> <%=
                        formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.currencyLocally8
                        )%> <%=
                        formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.amountAbroad1
                        )%> <% } %>
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                      <td>
                        <% if (formValue.utils.isAddNAText(formValue.type_visa))
                        { %>
                        <span>N/A</span>
                        <% } else { %> <%=
                        formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.payment2 )%> <%
                        } %>
                      </td>
                      <td>
                        House Rent: <% if
                        (formValue.utils.isAddNAText(formValue.type_visa)) { %>
                        <span>N/A</span>
                        <% } else { %> <%=
                        formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.currencyLocally2
                        )%> <%=
                        formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.amountLocally2
                        )%> <% } %>
                      </td>
                      <td>
                        House Rent: <% if
                        (formValue.utils.isAddNAText(formValue.type_visa)) { %>
                        <span>N/A</span>
                        <% } else { %> <%=
                        formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.currencyLocally9
                        )%> <%= formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.
                        amountAbroad2 )%> <% } %>
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                      <td>
                        <% if (formValue.utils.isAddNAText(formValue.type_visa))
                        { %>
                        <span>N/A</span>
                        <% } else { %> <%=
                        formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.payment4 )%> <%
                        } %>
                      </td>
                      <td>
                        Medical Allowance: <% if
                        (formValue.utils.isAddNAText(formValue.type_visa)) { %>
                        <span>N/A</span>
                        <% } else { %> <%=
                        formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.currencyLocally4
                        )%> <%=
                        formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.amountLocally4
                        )%> <% } %>
                      </td>
                      <td>
                        Medical Allowance: <% if
                        (formValue.utils.isAddNAText(formValue.type_visa)) { %>
                        <span>N/A</span>
                        <% } else { %> <%=
                        formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.currencyLocally12
                        )%> <%=
                        formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.amountAbroad4
                        )%> <% } %>
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                      <td>
                        <% if (formValue.utils.isAddNAText(formValue.type_visa))
                        { %>
                        <span>N/A</span>
                        <% } else { %> <%=
                        formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.payment5 )%> <%
                        } %>
                      </td>
                      <td>
                        Entertain. Allowance: <% if
                        (formValue.utils.isAddNAText(formValue.type_visa)) { %>
                        <span>N/A</span>
                        <% } else { %> <%=
                        formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.currencyLocally5
                        )%> <%=
                        formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.amountLocally5
                        )%> <% } %>
                      </td>
                      <td>
                        Entertain. Allowance: <% if
                        (formValue.utils.isAddNAText(formValue.type_visa)) { %>
                        <span>N/A</span>
                        <% } else { %> <%=
                        formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.currencyLocally13
                        )%> <%=
                        formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.amountAbroad5
                        )%> <% } %>
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                      <td>
                        <% if (formValue.utils.isAddNAText(formValue.type_visa))
                        { %>
                        <span>N/A</span>
                        <% } else { %> <%=
                        formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.payment6 )%> <%
                        } %>
                      </td>
                      <td>
                        Annual Bonus: <% if
                        (formValue.utils.isAddNAText(formValue.type_visa)) { %>
                        <span>N/A</span>
                        <% } else { %> <%=
                        formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.currencyLocally6
                        )%> <%=
                        formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.amountLocally6
                        )%> <% } %>
                      </td>
                      <td>
                        Annual Bonus: <% if
                        (formValue.utils.isAddNAText(formValue.type_visa)) { %>
                        <span>N/A</span>
                        <% } else { %> <%=
                        formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.currencyLocally14
                        )%> <%=
                        formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.amountAbroad6
                        )%> <% } %>
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                  </tbody>
                </table>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td colspan="3">
                Others: <% if (formValue.utils.isAddNAText(formValue.type_visa))
                { %>
                <span>N/A</span>
                <% } else { %> <%=
                formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.hOtherFringeBenefitsIfAny
                )%> <% } %>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td colspan="3">
                Remarks: <% if
                (formValue.utils.isAddNAText(formValue.type_visa)) { %>
                <span>N/A</span>
                <% } else { %> <%=
                formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.anyParticularComments
                )%> <% } %>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <ol class="un-order">
        <li>
          The expenditure in this connection would be borne out of foreign
          exchange remittance received from abroad. This condition in not
          applicable in case of appointment of foreign nationals in Foreign
          Bank, insurance, Airlines, Bangladeshi Company etc.
        </li>
        <li>
          If your Company earns profit locally and wants to meet the necessary
          expenditure of the company in Bangladesh with that profit, they can
          apply to the Board with proper justification and sufficient supporting
          documents for exemption of condition-1
        </li>
        <li>
          Appointment of Bangladeshi national as per ratio i.e. One Foreign
          national : Twenty Bangladeshi national [1:20] with suitable and
          appropriate pay structure shall have to be ensured.
        </li>
        <li>
          Income tax payable to the Government shall have to be deducted at
          source and to be paid as per provisions of Bangladesh Government I.T
          Ordinance 1984.
        </li>
        <li>
          The Foreign national(s) is / are required to submit Income Tex
          Certificate/Income Tax Exemption certificate according to the
          provision of section 107 of Income Tex Ordinance, 1984 before the
          concerned Income Tax office at the time of leaving Bangladesh as
          notified in office memorandum File No.Zarabo/Kar-7/A:A:B:/16/2005/38
          dated 18/03/2002 of the NBR.
        </li>
        <li>
          The date of departure of the expatriate(s) Must be intimated to BEZA
          within 7(seven) days from the date of expiry of the work permit. The
          company will also be held responsible for the illegal stay/employment
          of the foreign national, after expiry of the work permit.
        </li>
        <li>
          Ministry of Home Affairs will issue security clearance of the
          expatriate after verification.
        </li>
        <li>
          The foreign national shall have to be enlisted with Bangladesh Bank
          under section 18(A)(in case of branch/liaison/representative office)
          of the Foreign Exchange Act,1947.
        </li>
      </ol>

      <footer>
        <div class="cc-item">
          <p style="font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: bold">
            Cc to (Not According to Seniority) <br />
            For kind information and necessary action :
          </p>

          <ol style="list-style-type: decimal-leading-zero">
            <li>
              Senior Secretary/ Secretary, Ministry of Foreign Affairs,
              Segunbagicha, Dhaka
            </li>
            <li>
              Senior Secretary/ Secretary, Public Security Division, Ministry of
              Home Affairs, Bangladesh Secretariat, Dhaka
            </li>
            <li>
              Senior Secretary/ Secretary, Security Service Division, Ministry
              of Home Affairs, Bangladesh Secretariat, Dhaka
            </li>
            <li>
              Director General, Department of Immigration and Passport,
              Sher-e-Bangla Nagar, Agargaon, Dhaka
            </li>
          </ol>
        </div>
        <!-- <div class="signature">
          <h3>Yours faithfully</h3>
          <%-formValue.deskUserSignature %>
          <div style="margin-top: 0.35rem; line-height: 1.6">
            <p>
              <%= formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.deskUserFullName )%>
            </p>
            <p>
              <%= formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.deskUserDesignation
              )%>
            </p>
            <small>Bangladesh Economic Zones Authority (BEZA)</small>
          </div>
        </div> -->
      </footer>
      <div
        style="
          text-align: center;
          background: #dfbdcd;
          padding: 24px 0 24px 0;
          font-weight: 600;
          color: rgb(171, 34, 34);
          margin-top: 12px;
          opacity: 0.8;
        "
      >
        <p>
          THIS IS A COMPUTER GENERATED PERMIT. SO SIGNATURE IS NOT REQUIRED.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
